* Task 14 fixture: incremental updates reflected in workspace/symbol and definition
* Before the change: NEWSUB is not defined, CALLNAT 'NEWSUB' is unresolved
* After didChange: NEWSUB is added as a subroutine, CALLNAT resolves, workspace/symbol finds it

DEFINE DATA
LOCAL
  1 RESULT (A10)
END DEFINE

* This CALLNAT will be unresolved initially (NEWSUB.NSN doesn't exist yet)
CALLNAT 'NEWSUB'

MOVE 'OK' TO RESULT

END
